    "body": "Closes #41004\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nOpening an entry from a directory listing leaves the listing as the alternate file, so `<c-^>` returns to dir.lua instead of the file.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nKeep the alternate file when navigating out of a listing; entering one still sets it, so `<c-^>` from the listing returns to the originating buffer.\r\n\r\n@nathanzeng ",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-05T17:36:59Z",
